              "title": "Required owner decisions O217-1 through O217-7 remain unresolved",
              "details": "The exact issue contract blocks implementation and release publication pending authenticated, issue-specific owner answers for O217-1 through O217-7. These decisions determine canonical implementation ownership, the supported-platform matrix, default logical-tier behavior, signing and trust policy, stale-launcher migration, manifest freshness, and archive admission. The supplied truncated owner comment resolves none of them. Obtain complete authenticated answers for every applicable decision, then perform a complete review of the resulting exact issue version.",
