              "line": null
            },
            {
              "id": "df-9da84a7ba74f01539fff",
              "title": "Blocking dependency chain lacks trusted exact-revision evidence",
              "details": "The contract requires #253, #260, and #275 to be merged on their default branches with required checks green and the exact consumed revisions bound to #217 validation. The trusted state supplied for this review verifies only issue #217 and the repository default branch; it does not establish those dependency revisions, checks, ancestry, or consumption binding. Reconcile and complete the dependency chain, then provide exact default-branch revision evidence before admitting CLI/TUI implementation or release integration.",
